    {
      "text": "Wu Yong introduces him as the bloodline inheritor of Fire Thunder Divine Lord when claiming Fire Thunder true inheritance against Ba and Xia objections, then brings him to retrieve that inheritance from the fire thunder river segment. Narration names him Zhong Yi, a Western Desert Gu Master with ample talent and good character, taken in as a future Wu clan Gu Immortal seed and external elder prospect.",
